First, look around where you are to find something to eat.

Also #name one of your lamps "type 1" to find out if the other one is
different; then you know that you have a magic lamp.  (If they are both
the same, you may have 2 magic lamps, but you probably have none.)

Then you need to find an altar or a pet to B/U/C or pet-test whatever
armor you find.  Or, if you have the means to uncurse whatever you
have, try on promising stuff.  If you do get an altar you could try
altar camping, but you'll have to find some food first.

Then I would keep exploring downward from there, until you find
whatever tools necessary to get up past that big room.  Do you have
intrinsic telepathy?  A towel/blindfold?  Jumping boots or spell of
jumping?  Magic mapping?



